WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,370 --> 00:00:03,810
Do you think fate will open a back door for you?

2
00:00:03,810 --> 00:00:06,770
Destiny never bets on anyone

3
00:00:06,770 --> 00:00:08,050
I don't understand fate

4
00:00:08,050 --> 00:00:09,650
but know myself

5
00:00:09,650 --> 00:00:12,250
I seem to have always had good luck

6
00:00:12,250 --> 00:00:18,220
I think the answer is raw

7
00:00:18,220 --> 00:00:20,100
What do you think, Lu Beigui?

8
00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:21,460
Maybe

9
00:00:21,460 --> 00:00:22,940
maybe you are right

10
00:00:22,940 --> 00:00:25,490
Thank you little human being

11
00:00:26,370 --> 00:00:28,010
I'll just say

12
00:00:28,010 --> 00:00:29,210
I've always had good luck

13
00:00:29,210 --> 00:00:30,690
Impossible Impossible

14
00:00:30,690 --> 00:00:31,970
How could this be the case?

15
00:00:31,970 --> 00:00:34,410
This is a coin that will never be born.

16
00:00:38,590 --> 00:00:41,740
Although I don’t know if I will be alive

17
00:00:41,740 --> 00:00:42,820
No fate yet

18
00:00:43,920 --> 00:00:49,520
Bet takes effect and rewards are issued

19
00:00:49,520 --> 00:00:56,620
That's my goodbye

20
00:00:56,620 --> 00:00:58,260
Humans are cunning villains

21
00:00:58,260 --> 00:00:59,820
Influence villains to be cruel and greedy

22
00:00:59,820 --> 00:01:01,260
damn prophecy notebook

23
00:01:01,260 --> 00:01:02,340
You lied to me too

24
00:01:02,340 --> 00:01:03,940
You lied to me
